Z||000008||sjp777||06-30-2001||12:18 PM||||The guy I bought mine from kept everything. In addition to the sticker, I have a folder of every receipt from every part and service ever performed on the car. I have been keeping all the receipts from stuff I have done as well. Folder is mighty thick now  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>He also had the original sales brochures from Pontiac in 1988. I have one scanned and posted on my website if anyone wants to check it out. I'll scan and post the second one soon. I would post them here, but to get the clarity to read the article, the files are big. I don't want to clog up the thread.<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/890sm_4.jpg"> <BR>88GT 5sp, in desperate need of an LT1<BR><A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/fiero88gt1/" TARGET=_blank>http://www.geocities.com/fiero88gt1/</A>||||reg||1
